// # Net Mesh
//
// Logline: Peer-to-peer mesh + edge inference + OTA + power + open_*
// fixtures. Phase 3.3 reorg: merged the prior std/net/p2p_mesh/ and
// std/net/edge/ into a single std/net/mesh/ tree. The p2p_mesh/ subdir
// carried the chord DHT, gossip, routing table, plus a flat set of open_*
// fixtures (each prefixed with `open_` for a compiler-acceptance test).
// The edge/ subdir carried mesh networking, inference, OTA, and power
// governors. They are now one tree.
//
// Setup: Domain module under std/net/mesh. Pure compute, no caps.
//   * Mesh surface (4 files): mesh, mesh_engine, mesh_ops_*, mesh_types.
//   * Inference surface (6 files): edge inference engine, ops, pipeline, types, analysis, stubs.
//   * OTA surface (4 files): ota, ota_engine, ota_stubs, ota_types.
//   * Power surface (5 files): power, power_governor, power_ops, power_stubs, power_types.
//   * DHT + gossip + routing (3 files): dht_chord, gossip_mesh, routing_table.
//   * Open_* fixtures (40 files): one-file compiler-acceptance / regression fixtures (each starts with `open_`).
//
// Beats:
//   1. Edge stack: mesh, inference, ota, power.
//   2. P2P stack: dht_chord, gossip_mesh, routing_table.
//   3. Open_* fixtures: open_actor_restart, open_arena, open_bare_metal, open_ci_add, open_crypto_hmac, etc.

import "dht_chord.oo";
import "gossip_mesh.oo";
import "inference.oo";
import "inference_analysis.oo";
import "inference_ops.oo";
import "inference_pipeline.oo";
